This setting of the 205CA is centered on 14.250 MHz
for Phone operation.  It has a 2:1 VSWR band-width of
400 KHz centered on 14.200.  Maximum gain is 6.5 dBd
and maximum F/B is 30 dB.

Beta rod length= 17 inches (measured from inside 
tubing edge to outside edge of clamp).  Pigtail length= 
7 inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-86 (voltage type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in July 
1990. 9-23-91  RC





